  37:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      As prerequisite, fill in the HAL_XSPI_MspInit() :
  38:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) Enable XSPI clocks interface with __HAL_RCC_XSPI_CLK_ENABLE().
  39:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) Reset XSPI Peripheral with __HAL_RCC_XSPI_FORCE_RESET() and __HAL_RCC_XSPI_RELEASE_RESET()
  40:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) Enable the clocks for the XSPI GPIOS with __HAL_RCC_GPIOx_CLK_ENABLE().
  41:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) Configure these XSPI pins in alternate mode using HAL_GPIO_Init().
  42:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) If interrupt or DMA mode is used, enable and configure XSPI global
  43:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****          interrupt with HAL_NVIC_SetPriority() and HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ().
