  83:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      Hyperbus mode), it is sent directly to the memory :
  84:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) In polling mode, the output of the function is done when the transfer is complete.
  85:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) In interrupt mode, HAL_XSPI_CmdCpltCallback() will be called when the transfer is complete
  86:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****     [..]
  87:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      For the indirect write mode, use HAL_XSPI_Transmit(), HAL_XSPI_Transmit_DMA() or
  88:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      HAL_XSPI_Transmit_IT() after the command configuration :
  89:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) In polling mode, the output of the function is done when the transfer is complete.
  90:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) In interrupt mode, HAL_XSPI_FifoThresholdCallback() will be called when the fifo threshold
  91:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****          is reached and HAL_XSPI_TxCpltCallback() will be called when the transfer is complete.
  92:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) In DMA mode, HAL_XSPI_TxHalfCpltCallback() will be called at the half transfer and
  93:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****          HAL_XSPI_TxCpltCallback() will be called when the transfer is complete.
  94:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****     [..]
  95:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      For the indirect read mode, use HAL_XSPI_Receive(), HAL_XSPI_Receive_DMA() or
  96:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      HAL_XSPI_Receive_IT() after the command configuration :
  97:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) In polling mode, the output of the function is done when the transfer is complete.
  98:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) In interrupt mode, HAL_XSPI_FifoThresholdCallback() will be called when the fifo threshold
  99:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****          is reached and HAL_XSPI_RxCpltCallback() will be called when the transfer is complete.
 100:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****      (+) In DMA mode, HAL_XSPI_RxHalfCpltCallback() will be called at the half transfer and
 101:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_xspi.c ****          HAL_XSPI_RxCpltCallback() will be called when the transfer is complete.
